That's not (yet) stated in the doc, but the code
for rpy2.riniterface.__init__ tells it:

1- look for R_HOME
2- if not R_HOME, try to get R_HOME from an executable R in 
the $PATH/%Path%
3- if still nothing and win32, try to get R from the registry


L.


